<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Are you struggling with your dribbling skills and need an easy solution for two fundamental moves? Look no further! This simple macro will help you effortlessly outmaneuver your opponent with a crossover and step-back.


Set up To Q Or A Mouse Button(I use mouse button personally)  or another convenient one</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyDown 27 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 27 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyDown 27 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 27 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyDown 27 1
Delay 61 ms
KeyUp 27 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>